<title>BRAZIL: BR Distribuidora Q1 net 34.4 mln reais.</title>
<headline>BR Distribuidora Q1 net 34.4 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian oil and derivatives distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of state oil firm Petrobras, released the following statement on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>			    Q1 1997	   Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Net		 34.4 million	 N/A</p>
<p>    Gross revs	 2.344 bln	   N/A</p>
<p>    Net worth	  1.193 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>In dollar terms, Petrobras BR Distribuidora posted a net profit of $32.5 million in the first quarter, compared with $32.4 million in the same period of last year, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Rio de Janeiro newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
